WEBVTT

00:00:00.084 --> 00:00:02.449
Inlooveu: a university social platform.

00:00:02.719 --> 00:00:04.524
Built and launched by Pierre Burciaga.

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.676
1,800 historical registered accounts.

00:00:09.099 --> 00:00:11.659
Email-verified accounts.

00:00:11.963 --> 00:00:13.807
Profiles with interests and photos.

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:15.810
Preference-based discovery.

00:00:16.658 --> 00:00:19.413
An experience built with React and TypeScript.

00:00:22.099 --> 00:00:24.441
Touch interactions connect profile cards

00:00:24.453 --> 00:00:26.480
to likes and mutual-like detection.

00:00:27.328 --> 00:00:29.330
This recording uses controlled demo accounts

00:00:29.621 --> 00:00:31.624
in an isolated copy of the application.

00:00:34.099 --> 00:00:36.635
The chat combines persistence and real-time
updates.

00:00:37.471 --> 00:00:40.553
The API saves a message in MongoDB

00:00:40.566 --> 00:00:43.090
before Socket.IO notifies the other client.

00:00:49.099 --> 00:00:50.300
After a page reload,

00:00:50.603 --> 00:00:52.582
history is restored from the database.

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:57.459
The messages remain when the client is
reopened.

00:01:01.084 --> 00:01:04.134
React, Express, MongoDB and Socket.IO.

00:01:04.859 --> 00:01:06.985
Product, frontend, backend and deployment

00:01:07.244 --> 00:01:08.676
connected in one application.

00:01:10.099 --> 00:01:12.562
Explore the case study and engineering
decisions.
